<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Jan gold output falls to 38.39 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African Jan gold output falls to 38.39 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output fell in January to 38,388.5 kg from December's 43,994.1, Chamber of Mines figures show.</p>
</text>
